retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109891596045218035","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Mcfly2140 1.周线趋势向上，同时日线跌的时候买入\n2.底仓不超过两成\n3.竞价超过2%，但缩量直接卖出"},{"author_id":"1319659425091735552","conversation_id":"2109891596045218035","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:32:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109894935973675257"],"id":"2109894935973675257","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4634,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109891596045218035","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Mcfly2140 1. 仓位线（量化-20%/30%）：单票最大\n20%，单一行业最大30%。超限当天必须砍仓。能复查：交割单超限即违规。2. 止损线（量化-5%/-8%）：亏损5%减半，8%清仓。严禁补仓亏损头寸。能复查：账户亏损比例，亏超8%未清仓即违规。3. 纪律线（量化-1笔/15%）：主力连续3日净流出不开新仓；单日冲动交易最多"},{"author_id":"1319659425091735552","conversation_id":"2109891596045218035","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:35:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109895804139995554"],"id":"2109895804139995554","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3279,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109891596045218035","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Mcfly2140 1笔；换手率&gt;15%不追。能复查：周复盘对照交割单，找到冲动交易对应的亏损记录。最重要的是必须严格观察麦总推文内容😄ཽ"},{"author_id":"1825486785084076032","conversation_id":"2109891596045218035","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:02:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109917567544381643"],"id":"2109917567544381643","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2970,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109891596045218035","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Mcfly2140 9点20~25，成交额确定当天资金情绪，继续睡，起床吃饭，14点看盘，把昨天的卖了，买入已经暴力穷举认可的形态。\n吃喝玩乐"},{"author_id":"2015647415982804992","conversation_id":"2109891596045218035","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:28:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109893991198265519"],"id":"2109893991198265519","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4423,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109891596045218035","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Mcfly2140 必须周线MACD轴上金叉\n必须五日刚上穿20日线\n收盘价放量跌破20日线下无条件离场"},{"author_id":"1849495493166153728","conversation_id":"2109891596045218035","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:37:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109896238305010072"],"id":"2109896238305010072","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3858,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109891596045218035","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Mcfly2140 1\n1.  不做换手率低于8%的，理由是没有流动性\n2. 不做市值低于80亿的，盘子太小变数太大\n3. 不做结构复杂上下影线很长的，空头和多头博弈情况难以预估"},{"author_id":"1835230887598055424","conversation_id":"2109891596045218035","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:23:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109907802810651049"],"id":"2109907802810651049","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2975,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109891596045218035","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Mcfly2140 1. 开盘后的前30分钟不交易\n2. 不赌任何一家公司财报\n3. 单笔开仓不超过10%"},{"author_id":"1969470367082151936","conversation_id":"2109891596045218035","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:03:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109917902107558027"],"id":"2109917902107558027","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3505,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109891596045218035","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Mcfly2140 1. 控仓位：不加杠杆，单只股票买入后仓位不超过20%。\n2. 守止损：买入前定好止损价，触发后在可交易时执行，不临时下调。\n3. 防冲动：连续两笔亏损，暂停新开仓两个交易日，复盘后再交易。"},{"author_id":"2074382484179947520","conversation_id":"2109891596045218035","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:40:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110017752144675289"],"id":"2110017752144675289","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":7551,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109891596045218035","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Mcfly2140 1.看好的票，合适的买点，先一成仓位入场，根据涨跌决定后续投入，涨了不追，跌了稳定后再加仓。跌10%割肉。2.不做支撑位破位的票。3.手中股票4个以内，尽量不同板块"},{"author_id":"2017111940590686208","conversation_id":"2109891596045218035","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:29:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109894329338896617"],"id":"2109894329338896617","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3953,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109891596045218035","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Mcfly2140 1、不碰20日线以下的票 2、跌破5日线减仓一半 3、严格观察麦总推文内容"},{"author_id":"1811968420868763648","conversation_id":"2109891596045218035","created_at":"2026-10-13T08:35:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109925984459796962"],"id":"2109925984459796962","in_reply_to_user_id":"928496628570427392","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2252,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109891596045218035","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Mcfly2140 写规则不难，难的是亏钱那天还照着做。我跑小资金实盘这段时间最大的体会是，规则最好写到不需要临场判断的程度，不然情绪一上来，每一条都能找到例外。"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"2109673087923003649","created_at":"2026-10-12T15:50:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109673087923003649"],"id":"2109673087923003649","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":7199,"like_count":69,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":17},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2105147143812165646","type":"quoted"}],"text":"今天又有不少问进群的，看清楚了哦，是不是你心目中的理想群，所